HE4THER DS4 Windows HS
======================

This project is an ADVANCED CUSTOM EDITION of official DS4Windows,
with an additional macro window aimed at FPS-oriented controller macros.

Upstream project (official):
  https://github.com/Ryochan7/DS4Windows
  Final upstream version referenced: 3.3.3
  Status: archived by the original maintainer (read-only)

